@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-89289
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >
+        Plugins removed from core are no longer uninstalled synchronously
+        during the upgrade. Instead, the upgrade queues the new
+        `\core\task\uninstall_plugins_task` ad-hoc task, which uninstalls
+        the given plugins (if they are still installed and no longer present
+        on disk) after the upgrade has completed. Remaining qtype_random
+        questions are similarly deleted by the new
+        `\core\task\remove_qtype_random_task` ad-hoc task.
+      type: improved
